<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#TransitiveProperty> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of P148 has component: in DeSMòS, it relates a component to the complex expression or manifestation it belongs to. The original property has domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object and range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression (between expressions) or lrmoo:F3_Manifestation (between manifestations) and range lrmoo:F2_Expression or lrmoo:F3_Manifestation respectively."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P148i is component of"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di P148 has component: in DeSMòS collega una componente all'espressione o manifestazione complessa di cui fa parte. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object e come range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression (tra espressioni) o lrmoo:F3_Manifestation (tra manifestazioni) e come range rispettivamente lrmoo:F2_Expression o lrmoo:F3_Manifestation."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P148i è componente di"@it .
